# Edit-gate. To allow edits, create a file named `.claude/edit-gate` whose
# FIRST LINE is the repo-relative path of the audit/research/spec file being
# implemented, e.g.:
#   docs/ultimate-audit-2026-06-12/audit/a-12-partner-social.md  §"Invite funnel"
# No such file (or a path that doesn't exist) = all edits are BLOCKED.
